                                "sense_id": "652e8606-5df5-3cfd-bb48-e3a0a97a0b17",
                                "text": "The Crow-foot tribe is another group of plants yielding aconitina, delphinia, and other alkaloids, and the whole family is consequently to be suspected."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "054c3515-040d-4308-ae96-802625d18ce2",
                                "sense_id": "652e8606-5df5-3cfd-bb48-e3a0a97a0b17",
                                "text": "Strychnia, morphia, atropia, cantharadine, meconine, picrotoxia, and delphinia, after melting, deposited but a scanty carbonaceous ash;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0eb057a8-e4dc-4151-a5d4-fbc18d26b18f",
                                "sense_id": "652e8606-5df5-3cfd-bb48-e3a0a97a0b17",
                                "text": "Dr. Gauthier draws the following conclusions from his experiments on the physiological and toxicological effects of the delphinia."
                            }
                        ]
